#: src/help.c:51
msgid ""
"Each xpad session consists of one or more open pads.  These pads are "
"basically textboxes on your desktop in which you can write memos.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/help.c:55
msgid ""
"The contents of pads are transparently saved and reloaded when xpad is next "
"started.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/help.c:58
msgid ""
"To move a pad, left drag on the toolbar, right drag on the resizer in the "
"bottom right, or hold down CTRL while left dragging anywhere on the pad.\n"
"\n"
msgstr ""

#: src/help.c:62
msgid ""
"To resize a pad, left drag on the resizer or hold down CTRL while right "
"dragging anywhere on the pad.\n"
"\n"
