#: src/help.c:69
msgid "Please send comments or bug reports to xpad-devel@lists.sourceforge.net"
msgstr ""

#: src/help.c:81
msgid ""
"If a pad's style is locked, any changes made in the preference window to the "
"text, background, or border color or the font face do not affect that pad.\n"
"\n"
"To lock a pad's style, right click on a pad to open the popup menu and "
"select \"Lock Style\".  By default, pads are not locked."
